{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10014_01_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:940355e64d168615be3e1de1aa8c430da0df0ee5b02e0f8eb4197e800480d62a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00674212cabbabd7d21f351d73c7b8d619d002da16a540d3fcacd3d731e9defb",
      "text": "那我们再聊一会儿再过去吧。\n你还有想问的事对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f8494c9b9ca5ba86e64095e789f7c1dd7ef07cc2d46705eb7bd4ecc3d85d3c6",
      "text": "嗯、嗯！谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0807db2cde3b91d85fc3317acb7bbece3da013dd2ffb2110a41f9f053668ea7d",
      "text": "我在想，万一和弟弟或者妹妹吵架了该怎么办。\n因为经常听朋友这么说……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a99fbcabf011604d0c3ad53cbd01f498ff9eab5e63bdf07e37655750daccec5",
      "text": "这样啊。吵起架来的时候，\n确实会觉得可恶、很生气呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28a59ef5322a18ed3ac3b49432f77fc90f132c802ae8445cea917a18c1ccd7cb",
      "text": "可是，正因为吵架，\n有时候反而能明白对方真正的心意哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5808bb4eb355d77f6d6b042fe50993da612366b6cc2492c5e279d3bed72c7bb3",
      "text": "是这样吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8a7178ef718ff77fa7a7954591f2323a7e1ba45ded59354e53c4d85a9ce0cf7",
      "text": "嗯。你们以后要是吵架了一定也会明白的。\n越是吵架，感情就会变得越好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0635cb84eba021bd531fc2312f538a8e9a134cfa912060eb3ded17bf0b7b6a3b",
      "text": "然后，你作为哥哥，\n就能更好地保护弟弟妹妹了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22df0f0f354d962720a8f6814362e291eab269452d37e28b6c385fa90789cf43",
      "text": "能像那样一辈子一起犯傻、一起亲近的，\n就是兄弟和家人啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c95bb68f3592281d71a6a3802434ce6284a7a177b2e5bf1db5c6fc550cf99878",
      "text": "越吵架，感情越好……\n嗯，我知道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:331f534509821ce6013199e69fa01e871756d7f0b0bec6eeb37495920d489522",
      "text": "虽然听起来很不容易，但为了成为帅气的哥哥，\n我会好好特训的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:073390587dd528e20abac15fff59cb5ddfeaedc30e85d5387a21fbba3f472bf9",
      "text": "就是这个劲头！等小宝宝来到家里之后，\n一定会非常可爱的哦。所以，好好期待吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10014_01:1_3_10014_01_f:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:746451dfeb29d82639c1c200cabe067c739a4c5508116d10598f16fc6ce7a7b2",
      "text": "嗯！\n悠介君，谢谢你听我说这些！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
